=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the **Entrance: Coliseum** at {z:Rala Waterways} (M-6) for a cutscene.
** Upon entering the battlefield, your {@k} {k:Ash runic board} will be become a {@k} {k:Blank ash runic board}.
* This fight will be against {m:Teodor}.
** He will surrender below 10% HP.
** He does consistent AoE damage, but takes good magic (resistant to Sanguine Blade) and physical damage.
** He puts up {s:Dread Spikes} that will kill you from your own melee swings if not dispelled.
* After defeating {m:Teodor}, there will be a brief cutscene.

=2 Notes
* If you fail the battle, you must wait until the next game day and re-enter {z:Rala Waterways}.
** Upon zoning in, your {@k} {k:Blank ash runic board} will automatically convert back into an {@k} {k:Ash runic board}, allowing you to reattempt the battle.
* Completing this Mission allows you to obtain {@k} {k:Prototype sigil pearl} for {p:Vagary} entry.

